  "text": "def count_up_to(n):\n    \"\"\"Implement a function that takes a non-negative integer and returns an array of the first n\n    integers that are prime numbers and less than n.\n    \"\"\"\n    def is_prime(num):\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        for i in range(2, int(num**0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    primes = []\n    for i in range(2, n):\n        if is_prime(i):\n            primes.append(i)\n            if len(primes) == n:\n                break\n    return primes",
